 "notes": "Shelf 'Coffee machines' rebuilt into 5 kinds. All four old kinds kept (k63→Semi-automatic, k67→Manual lever, k64→Super-automatic, k61→Drip); Capsule coffee machine added new. Old flat model lists were converted to archetype versions where they belonged (Flair models → Flair 58 versions; Moccamaster SKUs → Moccamaster KBG versions; Silvia, Linea Mini, Classic Evo Pro, Oracle Touch, Series 3200, Xelsis → archetypes/versions); good models with no archetype (Bambino, Dedica, Anna, Victoria, Profitec Go, Oracle Touch, GE Café) stay in m. Drip kind's m list = current SCA Certified Home Brewer winners (retrieved list). Boiler types are t-types per the plan. Years left blank where no retrieved page gave them (ECM, Profitec, Rocket, Flair, Cafelat, ROK, Ratio, Bonavita founding; Breville model launch years). Dolce Gusto archetype carries mk 'Nespresso' only as Nestlé-system context; Lavazza A Modo Mio left maker-free because no Lavazza brand page was retrieved. The wiki tool was failing (lock error) so all Wikipedia pages were retrieved via web_fetch. No traditions apply to this shelf. Faema included in brands as the E61 originator although no archetype points to it.",
